      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE BLEND (2) was sent out big odds but ran the quickest time of the card (19.70) when an upset winner over 350m at this track. Solid record here including 19 wins. Great chance again. PAW VERA (6) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Wentworth Park over 520m behind Clarice Keeping (30.37) in a Grade 5. Shapes as one to consider. FREIGHT EXPRESS (4) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Found it a bit far latest when finished seventh over 520m at Wentworth Park (30.44) in a Grade 5 but is better suited back in trip here. Has a strong record at this distance including 13 wins. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Should be thereabouts. DOMINEERING (7) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 4/5 at Bulli over 400m.",
